{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Hecke.TwIndependent","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwIndependent","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Hecke.TwRep","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Finsupp.VectorSpace"],"declarations":16,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.coe_basisTw","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.coe_basisTw","kind":"theorem","line":168,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwIndependent.lean#L168-L173","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.basisTw","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.basisTw","kind":"def","line":153,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwIndependent.lean#L153-L166","doc":"**What is still missing, stated exactly.**  If the action on `T_1` is\nfaithful then the `T_w` are a basis of `H_n(q)` — so the whole basis theorem\nreduces to injectivity of `orbitMap`, equivalently `dim_K H_n(q) ≤ (n+1)!`.\n\nThis is a *conditional* statement and the hypothesis is **not** established\nhere: it is the content of Matsumoto's theorem (any two reduced words for\nthe same element differ by braid moves), which Mathlib lists as an open TODO\nat `Coxeter/Basic.lean:78`.  Do not read this definition as a proof that the\n`T_w` are a basis. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.linearIndependent_Tw","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.linearIndependent_Tw","kind":"theorem","line":143,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwIndependent.lean#L143-L151","doc":"**The `T_w` are linearly independent in `H_n(q)`.**  Hence\n`dim_K H_n(q) ≥ (n+1)!`, and no choice of reduced words can collapse them. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.orbitMap_Tw","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.orbitMap_Tw","kind":"theorem","line":139,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwIndependent.lean#L139-L141","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.Tw","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.Tw","kind":"def","line":135,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwIndependent.lean#L135-L137","doc":"`T_w ∈ H_n(q)`, built from the chosen reduced word. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.wordProd_reducedWord","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.wordProd_reducedWord","kind":"theorem","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwIndependent.lean#L131-L133","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.reducedWord_isReduced","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.reducedWord_isReduced","kind":"theorem","line":127,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwIndependent.lean#L127-L129","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.reducedWord","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.reducedWord","kind":"def","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwIndependent.lean#L122-L125","doc":"A choice of reduced word for each permutation.  Which one is chosen does not\nmatter below — that is the point. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.orbitMap_TwOf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.orbitMap_TwOf","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwIndependent.lean#L116-L120","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.orbitMap_foldl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.orbitMap_foldl","kind":"theorem","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwIndependent.lean#L105-L114","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.TwOf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.TwOf","kind":"def","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwIndependent.lean#L100-L103","doc":"The product of the generators along a word, applied on the left (the side\nthe cyclic module's action uses). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.applyWord_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.applyWord_one","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwIndependent.lean#L84-L89","doc":"The same, started at the identity, for a genuinely reduced word. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.applyWord_single","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.applyWord_single","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwIndependent.lean#L62-L82","doc":"**Along a reduced word the operators just walk the basis.**  No coefficients\nappear, because every step increases the length. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.applyWord_cons","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.applyWord_cons","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwIndependent.lean#L59-L60","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.applyWord_nil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.applyWord_nil","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwIndependent.lean#L57-L57","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.applyWord","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.applyWord","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwIndependent.lean#L53-L55","doc":"Apply the operators along a word, first letter first. ","signatureChunk":0}]}